# Open in Rider / VS Code (REST Client) while the sample runs (./samples/run.sh).
@host = http://localhost:5080

### Page 2 of 10 — note the X-Db-Commands: 2 header (page + COUNT)
GET {{host}}/products?page=2&pageSize=10

### Last, partial page — X-Db-Commands: 1 (COUNT skipped)
GET {{host}}/products?page=10&pageSize=10

### Past the end — empty items, totalCount still 95
GET {{host}}/products?page=50&pageSize=10

### Invalid input — 400 ProblemDetails
GET {{host}}/products?page=0&pageSize=10

### Optional paging without parameters — every row as one page
GET {{host}}/products/optional

### Optional paging with parameters
GET {{host}}/products/optional?page=1&pageSize=5

### Projection + Map
GET {{host}}/products/summaries?page=1&pageSize=3

### Unordered query — 500 explaining OrderBy is required
GET {{host}}/products/unordered

### PageRequest defaults — page 1, 20 items, default (Id) order
GET {{host}}/products/search

### Search + sort + paging from the query string
GET {{host}}/products/search?search=01&sort=-price,name&page=1&pageSize=5

### Oversized pageSize is clamped to 100
GET {{host}}/products/search?pageSize=500

### Unknown sort field — 400 listing the allowed fields
GET {{host}}/products/search?sort=secret

### Cursor feed — first page; copy nextCursor into the next request
GET {{host}}/products/feed?pageSize=10

### Cursor feed — next page
GET {{host}}/products/feed?pageSize=10&after=PASTE_NEXT_CURSOR

### Cursor feed — previous page
GET {{host}}/products/feed?pageSize=10&before=PASTE_PREVIOUS_CURSOR

### Cursor feed sorted by price — a cursor only works with the sort it came from
GET {{host}}/products/feed?pageSize=10&sort=-price

### Rename — UpdatedAt/UpdatedBy are stamped
PATCH {{host}}/products/95?name=Renamed
X-User: alice

### Soft delete — the row disappears from every list but stays in the table
DELETE {{host}}/products/95
X-User: alice

### Audit view (IgnoreQueryFilters) — shows createdAt/updatedBy/isDeleted/deletedBy
GET {{host}}/products/95/audit

### Generated SQL
GET {{host}}/debug/sql?page=3&pageSize=10
